        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5122LU, Keyed Luzern Lever with Square Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Keyed Luzern Lever with Square Rose has a dynamic style that fits so easily into most contemporary homes. It features a seamless blending of old and new; and will be that perfect finishing touch for any transitional home. The Keyed Luzern Lever with Square Rosette is available as a keyed entry function as well as a dummy function. Choose from several rich and contemporary finishes--all of them popular among the top home decorators. The Emtek 5122LU Leverset is easy to install and will fit doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets that are 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the Emtek Luzern Keyed Entry Lever with Square Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Clearance: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Rose Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-5122LU-specifications.pdf?v=1704262351\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek 5122LU Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. The lock is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, keys, door latch, and strike plate.\r\n<li><b>Dummy:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n Levers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
